        "created_at": "2015-03-18T12:30:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We have official rulings that:</p><p>1. If a target dealing damage is incapacitated it stops doing what it was doing.</p><p>2. Once selected, the lowest/highest HP target doesn't reselect during that action.</p><p>I think that makes it pretty clear that the damage stops once Set is incapped.</p>",
